{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COLORFLY is a <u><strong>Sokoban-style color puzzle game</strong></u> inspired by real-life color principles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player's goal is to <strong>reach the sketchbook with his or her own color matching.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In one clear rule, the adventures of logical colors unfold, constantly thinking and experimenting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Creative mix of different art materials</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint, brushes, colored sand... There are many different art tools in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each tool plays a special role in changing player's color.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124390/extras/cb6e1b1af783e1daccba4d7c2e33d188.poster.avif?t=1770674847\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124390/extras/cb6e1b1af783e1daccba4d7c2e33d188.webm?t=1770674847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124390/extras/cb6e1b1af783e1daccba4d7c2e33d188.mp4?t=1770674847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These tools mix and respond to each other and become new tools as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than <strong>10</strong> art tools, <strong>dozens</strong> of interaction results, and <strong>infinite</strong> <strong>possibilities</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use art tools to change colors, change situations, and feel the fresh charm of the <u>highly free color-based Sokoban puzzle game!</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124390/extras/f7c842c97bcca446becf6bf61e2a39f6.poster.avif?t=1770674847\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124390/extras/f7c842c97bcca446becf6bf61e2a39f6.webm?t=1770674847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Logical system of color circulation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The circular rule of color based on the theory of color in reality adds logic to the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The process of solving puzzles through the process of adding and subtracting colors provides the pleasure of experiencing the 'principle of color' beyond simple manipulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, the <u>in-game color simulator</u> allows you to see and understand the color change directly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124390/extras/112b2d6951c5b468944f8cdd580426a5.poster.avif?t=1770674847\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124390/extras/112b2d6951c5b468944f8cdd580426a5.webm?t=1770674847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Our color painted with pixel art</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COLORFLY's own pixel art depicts the world of adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While maintaining the retro sensibility provided by pixel art, it captured a bright and lively modern atmosphere suitable for color adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can immerse themselves more in the adventures of the main character, 'woo-ri' in COLORFLY's pixel world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124390/extras/29e8425d34b90772016b3bd07fbedd6d.poster.avif?t=1770674847\" width=472 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124390/extras/29e8425d34b90772016b3bd07fbedd6d.webm?t=1770674847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4124390?t=1770674847","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4124390?t=1770674847","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124390/17c10f4ee8ef445db8c1ac90765120e3b2e08e45/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770674847","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124390/17c10f4ee8ef445db8c1ac90765120e3b2e08e45/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770674847","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COLORFLY is a <u><strong>Sokoban-style color puzzle game</strong></u> inspired by real-life color principles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player's goal is to <strong>reach the sketchbook with his or her own color matching.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In one clear rule, the adventures of logical colors unfold, constantly thinking and experimenting.</p><p class=\"bb_par