lass=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Logical system of color circulation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The circular rule of color based on the theory of color in reality adds logic to the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The process of solving puzzles through the process of adding and subtracting colors provides the pleasure of experiencing the 'principle of color' beyond simple manipulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, the <u>in-game color simulator</u> allows you to see and understand the color change directly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124390/extras/112b2d6951c5b468944f8cdd580426a5.poster.avif?t=1770674847\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124390/extras/112b2d6951c5b468944f8cdd580426a5.webm?t=1770674847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Our color painted with pixel art</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COLORFLY's own pixel art depicts the world of adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While maintaining the retro sensibility provided by pixel art, it captured a bright and lively modern atmosphere suitable for color adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can immerse themselves more in the adventures of the main character, 'woo-ri' in COLORFLY's pixel world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124390/extras/29e8425d34b90772016b3bd07fbedd6d.poster.avif?t=1770674847\" width=472 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124390/extras/29e8425d34b90772016b3bd07f